'' definition on line 19), 191 for a setter with none or three, 213 for STATIC. Lines
'' 12 to 16 are the legal shapes and are accepted by both.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/property-shape.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 5
'' EXPECT-OUT: property-shape.bas(7,13): error TKO0786: a property getter takes no parameter, or one index
'' EXPECT-OUT: property-shape.bas(8,13): error TKO0787: a property setter takes its value, and at most one index before it
'' EXPECT-OUT: property-shape.bas(9,13): error TKO0787: a property setter takes its value, and at most one index before it
